OL,3,GNEWSAPair arrested after teenager dies
OL,4,Ain Nuneaton
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of allowing the death of a
OL,8,Fvulnerable person after a teenager
OL,9,Fdied.
OL,11,FOfficers were called by ambulance crews
OL,12,Fto College Stree in Nuneaton,
OL,13,FWarwickshire, at 15:41 GMT on Monday
OL,14,Fwhere they found a woman in her late
OL,15,Fteens suffering a cardiac arrest.
OL,17,FA 48-year-old woman and a 50-year-old
OL,18,Fman, both from Nuneaton, have since
OL,19,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of allowing
OL,20,Fthe death of a vulnerable adult.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
